 impressed by the character and background art, so I decided to send you a request.\n\n◇Composition\nI usually commission bright and cheerful illustrations, but this time I’d like you to create something with a different atmosphere.\nI’d be happy if you could include my dog as a companion in the illustration.\nI’ve attached some reference images for the outfit, so please feel free to choose whichever one you like best.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/13BJD0fb_OH8523q2sg7togjN1I-uQbH9?usp=sharing\n\n◇ Intended Use\nPosting on social media platforms like X\nUse as thumbnails for livestreams, etc.\n\n◇Delivery Format\nI’d like you to also provide a version with the background and character separated,\nand I’d appreciate it if you could ensure that the illustration around the face—including the hair—is not cropped off.\n\nI’m still new to sending requests, so I apologize if there are any omissions or errors.\nThank you for considering this request.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@laura097/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3126230, "client_id": 2778675, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a2909558/uploads/origins/72741b1a-137d-460b-8f74-be0b178d84f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2aa515b51f417dcab04396a16daf14c1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a2909558/uploads/origins/72741b1a-137d-460b-8f74-be0b178d84f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2aa515b51f417dcab04396a16daf14c1, https://si.imgix.net/a2909558/uploads/origins/72741b1a-137d-460b-8f74-be0b178d84f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48b05d7fbfb03eba5422d9b95dbb50dd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a2909558/uploads/origins/72741b1a-137d-460b-8f74-be0b178d84f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&f